{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-05-31 14:24:00', 'title': 'PG&E AND SHASTA COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY REACH SETTLEMENT TO FURTHER ENHANCE WILDFIRE SAFETY', 'text': 'AGREEMENT RESOLVES LEGAL PROCEEDING IN 2020 ZOGG FIRE OAKLAND, CALIF. , MAY 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT REACHED AN AGREEMENT WITH THE SHASTA COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY UNDER WHICH CRIMINAL CHARGES ARISING FROM THE 2020 ZOGG FIRE WILL BE DISMISSED.'}